<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mobile Number Updated</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 5px;">
        <h2 style="color: #2c3e50;">Mobile Number Updated</h2>
        <p>Hello {{name}},</p>
        <p>Your mobile number has been updated by an administrator.</p>
        <p><strong>New Mobile Number:</strong> {{mobileNumber}}</p>
        <p>Please note that your mobile number verification status has been reset. You will need to verify your new mobile number again to access certain features.</p>
        <p>If you did not authorized this change, please contact our support team immediately.</p>
        <br>
        <p>Best regards,</p>
        <p>The Support Team</p>
        <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin: 20px 0;">
        <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #999;">If you have any questions, please contact us at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a>.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
